-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Matkowski</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kornafel</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prognostic value of immunocytochemical estimation of estrogen receptor (ER) and of pS2 estrogen-dependent protein in cells of mammary ductal carcinoma. Analysis of five-year course of the disease</article-title><source>Folia Histochem Cytobiol</source><year>2001</year><volume>39</volume><fpage>143</fpage><lpage>144</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Folia Histochem Cytobiol||39|143||bib16|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11374797</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Surowiak</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Materna</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Klak</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Spaczynski</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dietel</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Kristiansen</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Lage</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Zabel</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prognostic value of immunohistochemical estimation of CD24 and Ki67 expression in cisplatin and paclitaxel treated ovarian carcinoma patients</article-title><source>Pol J Pathol</source><year>2005a</year><volume>56</volume><fpage>69</fpage><lpage>74</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Pol J Pathol||56|69||bib17|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16092668</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Surowiak</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Materna</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Paluchowski</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Ma